&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;79&quot; data-local-id=&quot;55b7cd728cf2&quot;&gt;When travelers are searching for a hotel, we want the obvious choice to be trivago! By comparing prices from major booking sites, we&#39;re making it easy for people to find hotels they want at a price they&#39;ll love. In the lively city of Düsseldorf, we seize opportunities to learn everyday, innovate, and make an enduring mark on the travel industry. A career at trivago is a journey designed for people who crave continuous development and want to thrive in a high-performing team. Here you will find those who aren&#39;t afraid of change but rather embrace it, turning every challenge into a pathway for growth. Join trivago, work with a great team, and grow with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Join-us-in-making-a-difference&quot; data-local-id=&quot;33e1354faab6&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot;&gt;Join us in making a difference&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;33e1354faab6&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot;&gt;Our Content team brings trivago&#39;s platform to life through consolidating textual data, images and AI-generated content — from inventories data (name, addresses, reviews, descriptions), the main image and photo galleries, to destination visuals, hotel highlights, and review summaries — delivered straight to travelers as they search. As a Working Student in Data &amp;amp; Insights, you&#39;ll sit between data science, product, and content operations, helping our small team ship features seen by millions. You&#39;ll work closely with scientists to dig into data, partner with our product manager on analysis that shapes decisions, and coordinate with external annotators to keep our quality bar high. It&#39;s a hands-on look at how a modern AI content pipeline runs end to end, with plenty of room to learn and grow as you build real data analytics and product skills — including the chance to pick up Python and SQL along the way. trivago is a place where ambition and support go hand in hand — we hold high standards and genuinely invest in each other&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;33e1354faab6&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca44df4a-63cf-471f-9e4c-50356230e0c5&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1854&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a4d025011bb0&quot;&gt;Work closely with engineers, data scientists and the product managers on analysis work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1945&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ba5e987d363&quot;&gt;Coordinate with external data annotators to perform quality checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2016&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0a63084eaf45&quot;&gt;Support the product manager with product analysis, including competitor benchmarking and market trend tracking relevant to trivago&#39;s AI-generated content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2174&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c09df9222c3d&quot;&gt;Analyze user behavior data to surface insights that inform product and content decisions across trivago&#39;s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2293&quot; data-local-id=&quot;04f312cc2745&quot;&gt;Implement models that generate data based on defined business rules to support content and product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2406&quot; data-local-id=&quot;dc589822181d&quot;&gt;Help translate data insights into product requirements and prioritization recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;33e1354faab6&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;33e1354faab6&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;743&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;efc8dcc0-83e4-4d1e-926d-b6679e771c38&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2531&quot; data-local-id=&quot;98f54aa32d62&quot;&gt;An interest in product management — comfortable translating data into clear requirements and helping shape prioritization decisions, while communicating effectively across a cross-functional team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8fa03ca4a334&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills — hands-on experience with Python and/or SQL is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2815&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c02b46cc924e&quot;&gt;Currently enrolled at a German university (Immatrikulationsbescheinigung required) and able to commute to our Düsseldorf office twice a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2902&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f80e1910eb48&quot;&gt;A genuine learning mindset — you approach challenges with curiosity, seek out feedback, and continuously look for ways to develop and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3045&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1918b4874517&quot;&gt;A performance mindset — you set ambitious goals for yourself and have the determination and resilience to follow through and achieve them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3187&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4fac8587151b&quot;&gt;An open and curious mindset toward AI tools and automation — you actively explore how AI can enhance your work and are excited to grow alongside evolving technologies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you-will-learn:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0c17613238e0&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3880&quot;&gt;What you will learn:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f4b92170-2090-4498-a12e-efff21004788&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3904&quot; data-local-id=&quot;74b2577c5a25&quot;&gt;How a modern AI content pipeline runs end-to-end — from data collection and annotation to production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4020&quot; data-local-id=&quot;edf1fa0cbc68&quot;&gt;How to translate business rules into working data models that power real product decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4115&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fe7b8a9c2575&quot;&gt;Practical, hands-on experience with Python and SQL in a live production environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4203&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d12959f7c517&quot;&gt;How data-driven teams evaluate and improve textual, visual and AI-generated content — from inventories data (name, addresses, reviews, descriptions), images and galleries to hotel highlights and review summaries — at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4430&quot; data-local-id=&quot;34363d4d88f0&quot;&gt;How to conduct product and competitor analysis, and translate data into requirements and prioritization decisions like a product manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3358&quot; data-local-id=&quot;43168266636e&quot;&gt;Not ticking every box? We still want to hear from you. Apply, tell us what motivates you, and you could be a great match—now or in the future. Your application does not need to include a photo. This is the recruitment process that you can expect for this role (subject to modifications):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;eb0a9346-49a7-494c-bd6a-de212d8ad3fb&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3649&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0e780fdb7df6&quot;&gt;Hireflix: One-way video interview&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3686&quot; data-local-id=&quot;aeb30452e2ce&quot;&gt;First call with Hiring Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3715&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0b5eb71cc640&quot;&gt;Technical interview with team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3779&quot; data-local-id=&quot;134921a1b0d3&quot;&gt;Want to know more about life at trivago? Check out what our colleagues say on &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/trivago&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;kununu&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-trivago-EI_IE673041.11,18.htm&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3779&quot; data-local-id=&quot;134921a1b0d3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you-can-look-forward-to:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6bf10325286b&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4571&quot;&gt;What you can look forward to:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4602&quot; data-local-id=&quot;963c20fb7cbb&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As you grow, so do we.&lt;/strong&gt; This is why at trivago, we prioritize your development, offer personalized coaching through Nilo, and provide workshops, educational meetups, conferences, free online learning courses, and access to a fully-equipped campus library.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4858&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4dac9479d18b&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Enjoy your office days.&lt;/strong&gt; Use your daily canteen budget to share lunch with colleagues in our canteen, help yourself to complimentary snacks and drinks in our kitchens, choose from a variety of fitness options with our on-site gym, sports classes, and Urban Sports Club membership, and enjoy the comfort of ergonomic desks and focused work areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f43703f8b86e&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Explore the latest tech development. &lt;/strong&gt;Keep up-to-date with the latest AI technology with company-sponsored AI token budgets. Whether it’s Cursor or Claude, you’re free to experiment with approaches to support you in completing the tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;heading-anchor-wrapper css-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thank you for considering a career at trivago! Our commitment to fostering an inclusive and enriching environment for all talents is at the heart of what we do. We understand that embarking on a new job opportunity is a blend of excitement and curiosity. Should any questions arise before you apply, feel free to reach out to us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:joinus@trivago.com&quot;&gt;joinus@trivago.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;. Join us in our mission to make a positive impact on global travel, w&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;e look forward to your application!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
